en:
@req:120@
@req:5171@
Eviscerate has a 20% chance per combo point to trigger Fingers of Frost (if known), but you can only gain Fingers of Frost with Eviscerate, and your Sinister Strike and Eviscerate critical strikes trigger an Ice Lance (if known) at your target during Slice and Ice.

Slice and Dice is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFSlice and Ice|r. Requires a single 2h weapon.

Your Cone of Cold is transformed into |cFFFFFFFFWinds of Winter|r, a finishing move only usable while Slice and Ice is active. Winds of Winter deals damage and increases your next Deep Freeze's damage by $979053s1% this effect stacks 3 times.
